{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1500023-what-spell-would-you-most-likely-waste-on-utterly-frivolous-ends","id":1500023,"title":"What Spell Would You Most Likely Waste On Utterly Frivolous Ends?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-12-18T03:53:39-08:00","id":1500023,"title":"What Spell Would You Most Likely Waste On Utterly Frivolous Ends?","content":"Not necessarily Wisdom Sins, but what spell would you most likely use for utterly frivolous purposes? <u>Scrying</u> picture windows, watching satellite TV in your head with <u>Tune In</u>, &quot;natural&quot; highs with Life/Mind spells, stuff like that.<br /> <br /> I'm partial to using <u>Levitation</u> rather than furniture.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 12-18-2022, 07:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-18T04:06:22-08:00","id":1500025,"title":"","content":"Death 5 Deny the Reaper. Keep your groceries fresh.<br /> <br /> Fate 5 Pariah. Screw over that jerk who cut you in traffic.<br /> <br /> Forces 5 Create Energy. Never need a torch or match or whatever when lighting campfires.<br /> <br /> Life 5 Create Life. Recreate that &quot;crickets chirp&quot; scene in anime whenever someone makes a bad joke.<br /> <br /> Matter 5 Ex Nihilo. When you keep losing your erasers and pencils.<br /> <br /> Mind 5 Social Networking. Get hundreds of Likes in YouTube, TikTok, whatever.<br /> <br /> Prime 5 Eidolon. Take pictures of photogenic scenery inside your house.<br /> <br /> Space 5 Quarantine. When your neighbors upstairs just won't keep quiet.<br /> <br /> Spirit 5 Birth Spirit. When you want an audience to clap for you whenever you do something.<br /> <br /> Time 5 Corridors of Time. You suddenly remembered this super stupid thing you said in front of your teen crush.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-18T04:12:50-08:00","id":1500026,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1500023-what-spell-would-you-most-likely-waste-on-utterly-frivolous-ends?p=1500025#post1500025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Death 5 Deny the Reaper. Keep your groceries fresh.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just use <u>Veil of Moments</u>. Much more economical. Ooo, an Imbued fruit bowl... or tupperware! <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1500023-what-spell-would-you-most-likely-waste-on-utterly-frivolous-ends?p=1500025#post1500025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Time 5 Corridors of Time. You suddenly remembered this super stupid thing you said in front of your teen crush.</div> </div> </div> </div>I said <i>frivolous</i> uses, not the reason we master Time magic in the first place!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-18T07:39:31-08:00","id":1500036,"title":"","content":"Death: Decay - Already took out the trash, composting is ready for use too<br /> <br /> Fate: Quantum Flux - I can be the designated driver AND drink all I want, sweet ! <br /> <br /> Forces: Control Weather - No more vacation days lost to rain<br /> <br /> Life: Lure &amp; Repel - See that pile of fish twice you height ? That was an hour's work, with a fishing pole. Who is telling a fisherman's tale now ?<br /> <br /> Matter: Shaping - This wall is a door now, going around is too much work<br /> <br /> Mind: Hallucination - Every presentation and story is an AR experience to remember <br /> <br /> Prime: Eidolon - Change house decorations anytime you want<br /> <br /> Space: Locate Object - Never lose your keys again and now its easy to check if you packed everything you need for the trip<br /> <br /> Spirit: Coaxing the Spirits - I am the universal remote<br /> <br /> Time: Blink of an Eye - All the boring and unpleasant things are finished, with plenty of time left to enjoy the day","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-18T08:11:02-08:00","id":1500037,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m planning a character that really uses magic for inane reasons. That being said, this is my list, and I\u2019d be so bad about this, you don\u2019t even know.<br /> <br /> Forces Unveiling to listen to music in the shower without the water ruining the sound quality.<br /> <br /> Forces Unveiling to see outside the visual spectrum, so I can see all the hidden colors of the world.<br /> <br /> Forces Unveiling Nightvision\u2026self explanatory.<br /> <br /> Forces/Matter Ruling\u2026sometime in video games the character doesn\u2019t actually do exactly what you input into the controller, you know?<br /> <br /> Forces Ruling Influence Heat, because I really want to wear long sleeves and other winter stuff all the time, but I currently live in a place where that\u2019s a good way to get heat stroke for most of the year.<br /> <br /> Forces Fraying to cut hair and shave / Time Perfecting Acceleration to grow my hair faster to I can try out different cuts. Or just grow it as long as I want.<br /> <br /> Prime Unveiling Pierce Deception\u2026I can\u2019t read body language\u2026or tell when people lie to me\u2026and get paranoid about it sometimes (Sorry, not as fun, but it\u2019s what I\u2019d use it for.)<br /> <br /> Prime Perfecting Platonic Form, for when you want a comfortable chair or pillow.<br /> <br /> Mind perfecting Sleep of the Just\u2026no more terrible sleep schedule for me! My sleep is now as restful as I want!<br /> <br /> Life Weaving Many Faces\u2026I want to see what having other bodies is like. Maybe I\u2019d like a different form better. And sometimes you just need to be a little taller or shorter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-18T14:03:01-08:00","id":1500069,"title":"","content":"Forces, Control Heat. Fuck Winter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-18T14:50:41-08:00","id":1500072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1500023-what-spell-would-you-most-likely-waste-on-utterly-frivolous-ends?p=1500069#post1500069\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Forces, Control Heat. Fuck Winter.</div> </div> </div> </div>The snow plow left a giant furrow of ice in front of my garage door this morning. Parking the car is going to be a nightmare this evening - being able to melt a path with the flick of the wrist would be a godsend.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-18T14:58:43-08:00","id":1500073,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1500023-what-spell-would-you-most-likely-waste-on-utterly-frivolous-ends?p=1500072#post1500072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The snow plow left a giant furrow of ice in front of my garage door this morning. Parking the car is going to be a nightmare this evening - being able to melt a path with the flick of the wrist would be a godsend.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yikes, that is not fun.<br /> <br /> For me, it's mostly more a matter of never suffering because I forgot thermals, or indeed having to choose between cute or practical outfits (yes, I am that bitch). While dealing with ice and snow with the and around the car is also a perk, I could put off getting to that level of lazy so long as I could be warm no matter what.<br /> <br /> Though yeah, eventually that would evolve into &quot;And now that's all melted and gone to freeze in a place where it's someone else's problem.&quot; I'll feel like crap when it's someone's grandmother, but in the meantime.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-19T05:29:30-08:00","id":1500092,"title":"","content":"Telekinesis, because sometimes I don't want to get up for that thing.<br /> <br /> Mind, that happens to be one that really brings into focus some of the impositions of that whole &quot;have to see or hear it&quot; requirement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-19T14:56:51-08:00","id":1500138,"title":"","content":"Using Fate to never have to wait for traffic again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-19T16:42:27-08:00","id":1500145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally p